== Notes ==
* This spell can target [[placeable]]s, which will automatically fail the saving throw (no roll is made), and are destroyed (unless [[plot]]).
* This spell does not have a "death" [[descriptor]], so immunity to death magic only prevents the death [[effect]] upon a failed saving throw; it does not prevent the damage resulting from a successful save.

